sn35.75:6.1 starts: “If you understand that I have not taught
sn35.75:8.3 starts: for I have taught the Dhamma with total
sn35.75:11.2 starts: “… Is the ear constant or inconstant?”
sn35.75:11.3 starts: “… Is the nose constant or inconstant?”
sn35.75:11.4 starts: “… Is the tongue constant or inconstant?”
sn35.75:11.5 starts: “… Is the body constant or inconstant?”
iti110:4.1 starts: “If, while he is sitting.…
iti110:5.1 starts: “If, while he is lying down, there arises
iti110:8.1 starts: “If, while he is sitting.…
iti110:9.1 starts: “If, while he is lying down, there arises
mn70:12.5 starts: They have done their task with heedfulness.
mn70:24.2 starts: there hasn’t been that visiting,
mn70:24.3 starts: there hasn’t been that growing close…
mn70:24.4 starts: that lending ear…
mn70:24.5 starts: that hearing of the Dhamma…
mn70:24.6 starts: that remembering…
mn70:24.7 starts: that penetration of the meaning of the teachings…
mn70:24.8 starts: that agreement through pondering the teachings…
mn70:24.11 starts: that contemplation…
mn70:24.12 starts: that exertion.
